<title>JAPAN: NTT mobile phone unit to boost 96/97 investment.</title>
<headline>NTT mobile phone unit to boost 96/97 investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>NTT Mobile Communications Inc (NTT Docomo), a unit of Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp, said on Friday it would boost investment for the 1996/97 business year by 80 billion yen to 400 billion yen in response to the growing number of subscribers for its mobile phones.</p>
</text>
